--------------------------- Changelog -----------------------------

1.1.a - UNRELEASED
Added - Tile unfold setting for the Tiles layout: On hover (default), On click (only the clicked market's tile expands) or Never (icons only)
Adjusted - The Unfold on hover layout is now called Tiles; a saved Unfold on hover becomes Tiles with On hover

1.0.a
Added - Market buttons fill each row on the cargo and fleet screens, with Storage at the bottom right
Added - Three layouts: Unfold on hover (default), Stretched and Five per row
Added - Adjustable unfold time from 0 to 1 second, defaulting to 0.1
Added - Selected button highlights: Animated (default), Bright band and Off
Added - Button backgrounds fit their frames; enabled by default
